    "body": "I have the same problem with using the same environments (**termux** and **zsh**).\r\n\r\nI found out that this problem doesn't happen when I use **bash** instead.\r\n\r\nThe problem must lie somewhere in this code with the format of the numbers which are printed:\r\nhttps://github.com/starship/starship/blob/ecd3d6e9f0d64f6d0a53a97796fb769de6976457/src/init/starship.zsh#L20\r\n\r\nI am not expert of this; I tried to figure out the problem myself.\r\nI did some researching to figure out why it happens, so I found a hint here:\r\nhttps://unix.stackexchange.com/a/474132\r\n\r\nHope it helps if someone more experienced will step in to solve the problem.\r\n",
